[{"answer":"Hi, Julie, it's Ricky.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-19-2019-03-28-13-40-42/1.mp3"},{"answer":"Hi, Ricky, how are you?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-19-2019-03-28-13-40-42/2.mp3"},{"answer":"I noticed you weren't in Psychology today.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-19-2019-03-28-13-40-42/3.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm feeling sick, so I didn't go to school today.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-19-2019-03-28-13-40-42/4.mp3"},{"answer":"Would you mind telling me what I missed in class?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-19-2019-03-28-13-40-42/5.mp3"},{"answer":"Sure thing. I'm sorry you're not feeling well!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-19-2019-03-28-13-40-42/6.mp3"},{"answer":"Anyway, we spent most of the class talking about a new essay that Professor Johnson assigned.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-19-2019-03-28-13-40-42/7.mp3"},{"answer":"You need to choose one of the bold headings from the note system and research it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-19-2019-03-28-13-40-42/8.mp3"},{"answer":"Wow, I picked the wrong day to miss class, huh?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-19-2019-03-28-13-40-42/9.mp3"},{"answer":"You sure did.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-19-2019-03-28-13-40-42/10.mp3"},{"answer":"Could you tell me the specific requirements of this paper?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-19-2019-03-28-13-40-42/11.mp3"},{"answer":"Sure.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-19-2019-03-28-13-40-42/12.mp3"},{"answer":"You need to find scientific research that supports your claim as one of your references.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-19-2019-03-28-13-40-42/13.mp3"},{"answer":"It can be from some of the case studies we discussed in class, or you can find your own.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-19-2019-03-28-13-40-42/14.mp3"},{"answer":"Or even better, you can conduct your own research!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-19-2019-03-28-13-40-42/15.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm sure that would get you an A.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-19-2019-03-28-13-40-42/16.mp3"},{"answer":"Have you decided what you're going to do yet?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-19-2019-03-28-13-40-42/17.mp3"},{"answer":"Also, where are you getting your references?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-19-2019-03-28-13-40-42/18.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah, I'm gonna research facial recognition by infants.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-19-2019-03-28-13-40-42/19.mp3"},{"answer":"I've already found a few experiments in scientific journals.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-19-2019-03-28-13-40-42/20.mp3"},{"answer":"That would probably be a good start for you - there are tons of journals in the library.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-19-2019-03-28-13-40-42/21.mp3"},{"answer":"Great idea, thanks.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-19-2019-03-28-13-40-42/22.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm considering writing my essay on the effects of one of the psychotropic drugs we talked about in class.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-19-2019-03-28-13-40-42/23.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm sure there is lots of stuff about it on the Internet.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-19-2019-03-28-13-40-42/24.mp3"},{"answer":"Are we allowed to use information from the Internet?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-19-2019-03-28-13-40-42/25.mp3"},{"answer":"Sure, you can use that as long as it's not your main source for information.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-19-2019-03-28-13-40-42/26.mp3"},{"answer":"You'll probably want to cite some of the experiments we went over.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-19-2019-03-28-13-40-42/27.mp3"},{"answer":"Good idea, thanks.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-19-2019-03-28-13-40-42/28.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm gonna try to find some information from a bunch of different sources.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-19-2019-03-28-13-40-42/29.mp3"},{"answer":"Are there any specifications on how the essay should be written?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-19-2019-03-28-13-40-42/30.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah, Professor Johnson wants it double-spaced.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-19-2019-03-28-13-40-42/31.mp3"},{"answer":"It should be between 6 to 10 pages long.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-19-2019-03-28-13-40-42/32.mp3"},{"answer":"6 to 10 pages? That's so much!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-19-2019-03-28-13-40-42/33.mp3"},{"answer":"Ah, it's gonna take forever.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-19-2019-03-28-13-40-42/34.mp3"},{"answer":"I know. The whole class groaned when he said that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-19-2019-03-28-13-40-42/35.mp3"},{"answer":"Anyway, you also need to put the title in italics...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-19-2019-03-28-13-40-42/36-2019-04-30-05-44-12.mp3"},{"answer":"Wait, each section heading, or just the main heading?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-19-2019-03-28-13-40-42/37.mp3"},{"answer":"Only the main heading should be in italics.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-19-2019-03-28-13-40-42/38.mp3"},{"answer":"I think section titles are supposed to be in the same format, but maybe in bold.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-19-2019-03-28-13-40-42/39.mp3"},{"answer":"You'll have to check that in class next time.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-19-2019-03-28-13-40-42/40.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh okay.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-19-2019-03-28-13-40-42/41.mp3"},{"answer":"So I take it that the report has to be typed since there are so many requirements.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-19-2019-03-28-13-40-42/42.mp3"},{"answer":"What are the other formatting requirements?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-19-2019-03-28-13-40-42/43.mp3"},{"answer":"Yep, it's got to be typed.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-19-2019-03-28-13-40-42/44.mp3"},{"answer":"Aside from that, there are still a few more specifications.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-19-2019-03-28-13-40-42/45.mp3"},{"answer":"You should number each page.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-19-2019-03-28-13-40-42/46.mp3"},{"answer":"Make sure it goes up in the top right corner.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-19-2019-03-28-13-40-42/47.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay, I'll make sure to write that down.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-19-2019-03-28-13-40-42/48.mp3"},{"answer":"I always forget to number the pages.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-19-2019-03-28-13-40-42/49.mp3"},{"answer":"Do we need to title and date each page, too?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-19-2019-03-28-13-40-42/50.mp3"},{"answer":"You need the shortened title on every page, but no need to include the date.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-19-2019-03-28-13-40-42/51.mp3"},{"answer":"That should just be on the cover page.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-19-2019-03-28-13-40-42/52.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay, thanks.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-19-2019-03-28-13-40-42/53.mp3"},{"answer":"No problem.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-19-2019-03-28-13-40-42/54.mp3"},{"answer":"Also, make sure the margins are 3.25 pixels wide.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-19-2019-03-28-13-40-42/55.mp3"},{"answer":"What?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-19-2019-03-28-13-40-42/56.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm not even sure how to do that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-19-2019-03-28-13-40-42/57.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, it's okay, I can show you. It's really easy.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-19-2019-03-28-13-40-42/58.mp3"},{"answer":"I think that's all the directions he gave us.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-19-2019-03-28-13-40-42/59.mp3"},{"answer":"A lot of formatting requirements,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-19-2019-03-28-13-40-42/60.mp3"},{"answer":"but we have the freedom to research many things that we like, so that's good.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-19-2019-03-28-13-40-42/61.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, I almost forgot,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-19-2019-03-28-13-40-42/62.mp3"},{"answer":"remember to put down your ID number on your report.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-19-2019-03-28-13-40-42/63.mp3"},{"answer":"Thanks so much for your help.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-19-2019-03-28-13-40-42/64.mp3"},{"answer":"I'll see you in class Monday!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-19-2019-03-28-13-40-42/65.mp3"},{"answer":"No problem, glad I could help. See you later.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-19-2019-03-28-13-40-42/66.mp3"}]
